- Paleta dark declarada no asset: header `#0F1F16`, row base `#13261C`, zebra `#182C21`, hover `#1E3627`, selected `#1F4D33`, borda `#274233`, texto `#E6F2EA`, secundario `#A6B7AE`, disabled `#5E6E63`, success `#2ECC71`, warning `#F5B528`, error `#E74C3C`, focus outline `#3DE184`, scrollbar `#2C3F34`. As superficies claras aplicam os mesmos papeis, nao o mesmo hex.

